* Premature ovarian insufficiency: ① Women aged \>18 and \ 25IU/L (interval \>4 weeks) at least 2 times, or total antral follicles (AFC) \ 3 times the normal upper limit or estimated glomerular filtration rate (EGFR) \< 90 ml/min;
* Suffering from hemorrhagic diseases (such as hemophilia) or taking anticoagulant or antiplatelet drugs;
