8. bupropion
9. vilazodone
10. vortioxetine

Exclusion Criteria:

1. Within the patient's lifetime, has a confirmed DSM-5 psychiatric diagnosis other than MDD, including:

1. Schizophrenia, Schizoaffective Disorder, Schizophreniform Disorder or other psychotic disorder;
2. Bipolar Disorder;
